question:
Consumer đọc đoạn code dưới đây. Nếu process crash sau khi commit nhưng trước khi `saveToDb` xong, đảm bảo giao nhận là gì?
`const records = await consumer.poll();
await consumer.commit();
for (const r of records) {
  await saveToDb(r);
}`

questionEn:
A consumer runs the code below. If the process crashes after the commit but before `saveToDb` finishes, what delivery guarantee is this?
`const records = await consumer.poll();
await consumer.commit();
for (const r of records) {
  await saveToDb(r);
}`

